<li>&lt;a href="Paradigala%20buntut-panjang"&gt;Paradigala buntut-panjang&lt;/a&gt; (Paradigalla carunculata); Papua.</li>
<li>&lt;a href="Astrapia%20Arfak"&gt;Astrapia Arfak&lt;/a&gt; (Astrapia nigra); endemik Papua, &lt;a href="Indon%C3%A9sia"&gt;Indonésia&lt;/a&gt;.</li>
