<doc id="34582" url="https://su.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=34582" title="Snow Patrol">
Snow Patrol

Snow Patrol nyaéta grup musik &lt;a href="rock%20alternatip"&gt;rock alternatip&lt;/a&gt; asal &lt;a href="Skotlandia"&gt;Skotlandia&lt;/a&gt; anu ayeuna ngabasis di &lt;a href="Bangor"&gt;Bangor&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Irlandia"&gt;Irlandia&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Kal%C3%A9r"&gt;Kalér&lt;/a&gt;. Snow Patrol dibentuk ku &lt;a href="Mark%20McClelland"&gt;Mark McClelland&lt;/a&gt; jeung &lt;a href="Michael%20Morrison"&gt;Michael Morrison&lt;/a&gt;. Personil Snow Patrol di antarana: &lt;a href="Gary%20Lightbody"&gt;Gary Lightbody&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="vokal"&gt;vokal&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="piano"&gt;piano&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="gitar"&gt;gitar&lt;/a&gt;), &lt;a href="Jonny%20Quinn"&gt;Jonny Quinn&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="drum"&gt;drum&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="perkusi"&gt;perkusi&lt;/a&gt;), &lt;a href="Nathan%20Connolly"&gt;Nathan Connolly&lt;/a&gt; (gitar, backing vocal), &lt;a href="Paul%20Wilson"&gt;Paul Wilson&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="bass"&gt;bass&lt;/a&gt;, backing vocal) jeung &lt;a href="Tom%20Simpson"&gt;Tom Simpson&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="keyboard"&gt;keyboard&lt;/a&gt;). Anggota asli Snow Patrol nu masih aya nepi ka ayeuna ti mimiti ieu grup dibentuk nyaéta Lightbody jeung Quinn wungkul. Dina awal karirna, Snow Patrol ngarilis 3 album EP (Extended Play) jeung album studio SONGS FOR POLARBEAR (&lt;a href="1998"&gt;1998&lt;/a&gt;) jeung WHEN IT'S ALL OVER WE STILL HAVE TO CLEAR UP (&lt;a href="2001"&gt;2001&lt;/a&gt;), tapi album-album ieu kurang suksés di Pasar musik. Baheula Snow Patrol sok disebut Polar Bear lantaran album Songs for Polarbear anu dirilisna.
<h2>Diskografi</h2>
Diskografi.
Taun &lt;a href="1998"&gt;1998&lt;/a&gt;, Snow Patrol ngarilis album SONGS OF THE POLARBEARS, anu diteruskeun ku abum WHEN IT'S ALL OVER WE STILL HAVE TO CLEAR UP (&lt;a href="2001"&gt;2001&lt;/a&gt;). Taun &lt;a href="2003"&gt;2003&lt;/a&gt;, Snow Patrol ngarilis album FINAL STRAW. Album EYES OPEN dirilis taun &lt;a href="2006"&gt;2006&lt;/a&gt;, diterusken ku album A HUNDRED MILLION SUNS taun &lt;a href="2008"&gt;2008&lt;/a&gt;. Album FALLEN EMPIRE anu dirilis taun &lt;a href="2011"&gt;2011&lt;/a&gt; ieu.
