Maroon 5

Maroon 5 nyaéta grup musik &lt;a href="pop%20rock"&gt;pop rock&lt;/a&gt; asal &lt;a href="Los%20Angeles"&gt;Los Angeles&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="kalifornia"&gt;kalifornia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Amerika%20Serikat"&gt;Amerika Serikat&lt;/a&gt; kalayan anggota &lt;a href="Adam%20Levine"&gt;Adam Levine&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="vocal"&gt;vocal&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="gitar"&gt;gitar&lt;/a&gt;), &lt;a href="James%20Valentine"&gt;James Valentine&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="gitar"&gt;gitar&lt;/a&gt;, backing vocals), &lt;a href="Jesse%20Carmichael"&gt;Jesse Carmichael&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="keyboard"&gt;keyboard&lt;/a&gt;, backing vocals), &lt;a href="Mickey%20Madden"&gt;Mickey Madden&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="bass"&gt;bass&lt;/a&gt;, backing vocals) jeung &lt;a href="Matt%20Flynn"&gt;Matt Flynn&lt;/a&gt; (drum). Saacan resmi jadi Maroon 5, ieu grup musik dingaranan Kara's Flower dina taun &lt;a href="1995"&gt;1995&lt;/a&gt;. Nalika masih kénéh maké ngaran Kara's Flower, Adam Levine dkk kungsi nyieun album di taun &lt;a href="1997"&gt;1997&lt;/a&gt;, harita posisi drummer dieusian ku &lt;a href="Ryan%20Dusick"&gt;Ryan Dusick&lt;/a&gt; anu kaluar taun &lt;a href="2006"&gt;2006&lt;/a&gt; terus digantikeun ku Matt. Ngaran Maroon 5 diresmikeun taun &lt;a href="2001"&gt;2001&lt;/a&gt;,bareng jeung asupna James ka ieu grup. Maroon 5 kasohor ku lagu andalanna Harder to Breathe, This Love, She Will Be Loved, Sunday Morning jeung Makes Me Wonder.
<h2>Diskografi</h2>
Diskografi.
Album SOngs About Jane dirilis taun &lt;a href="2002"&gt;2002&lt;/a&gt;, diteruskeun ku album It Won't be Soon Before Long taun &lt;a href="2007"&gt;2007&lt;/a&gt;. Ngaliwatan 2 album ieu jeung singlena, Maroon 5 meunang sababaraha panglélér, di antarana: Grammy Award pikeun Best New Artist, Grammy Award pikeun Best Pop Performance By A Duo Or Group With Vocal kalayan lagu This Love, jeung panglélér séjénna. Taun &lt;a href="2010"&gt;2010&lt;/a&gt; kamari, Maroon 5 ngarilis album Hands All Over.
