Kriméa atawa Républik Otonom Kriméa (&lt;a href="Basa%20Ukraina"&gt;Basa Ukraina&lt;/a&gt;:, Avtonomna Respublika Krym; &lt;a href="Basa%20Rusia"&gt;Basa Rusia&lt;/a&gt;:, Avtonomnaya Respublika Krym; &lt;a href="basa%20Tatar%20Krimea"&gt;basa Tatar Krimea&lt;/a&gt;: 
