<doc id="34702" url="https://su.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=34702" title="System of a Down">
System of a Down

System Of a Down (SOAD) nyaéta grup musik &lt;a href="rock%20metal"&gt;rock metal&lt;/a&gt; asal &lt;a href="Kalifornia"&gt;Kalifornia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Amerika%20Serikat"&gt;Amerika Serikat&lt;/a&gt; anu dibentuk taun &lt;a href="1994"&gt;1994&lt;/a&gt;. Personil SOAD sakabéhna katurunan &lt;a href="Armenia"&gt;Armenia&lt;/a&gt;, di antarana: &lt;a href="Serj%20Tankian"&gt;Serj Tankian&lt;/a&gt; (Vokal, &lt;a href="keyboard"&gt;keyboard&lt;/a&gt;), &lt;a href="Daron%20Malakian"&gt;Daron Malakian&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="vokal"&gt;vokal&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="gitar"&gt;gitar&lt;/a&gt;), &lt;a href="Shavo%20Odadjian"&gt;Shavo Odadjian&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="bass"&gt;bass&lt;/a&gt;), jeung &lt;a href="John%20Dolmayan"&gt;John Dolmayan&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="drum"&gt;drum&lt;/a&gt;). Ngaran System Of a Down srangan dicokot tina judul &lt;a href="sajak"&gt;sajak&lt;/a&gt; Malakian anu judulna Victime of the Down, anu saterusna ku Odadijan éta kecap Victime diganti jadi System, sabab ceuk manéhna mah ieu kecap téh miboga harti nu leuwih jembar.
Aliran musik SOAD loba kapangurahn ku sababraha genre saperti &lt;a href="rock%20alternatip"&gt;rock alternatip&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="punk%20rock"&gt;punk rock&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="musik%20folk"&gt;musik folk&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="psychedelic%20rock"&gt;psychedelic rock&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="symphonic%20metal"&gt;symphonic metal&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="thrash%20metal"&gt;thrash metal&lt;/a&gt;, jeung &lt;a href="rock%20progesif"&gt;rock progesif&lt;/a&gt;. SOAD ogé sok maké &lt;a href="waditra"&gt;waditra&lt;/a&gt; anu kawilang rumit sangkan musikna miboga variasi saperti: &lt;a href="mandolin%20%C3%A9l%C3%A9ktrik"&gt;mandolin éléktrik&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="gitar%20%C3%A9l%C3%A9ktrik"&gt;gitar éléktrik&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="gitar%20akustik"&gt;gitar akustik&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="kacapi%20arab"&gt;kacapi arab&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="siter"&gt;siter&lt;/a&gt;, jeung &lt;a href="gitar%2012%20senar"&gt;gitar 12 senar&lt;/a&gt;, malah mah nepi ka &lt;a href="keyboard"&gt;keyboard&lt;/a&gt; jenis &lt;a href="synthesizers"&gt;synthesizers&lt;/a&gt; ogé dipaké.
<h2>Diskografi</h2>
Diskografi.
Album pertamana dijudulan SYTEM OF A DOWN anu dirilis taun &lt;a href="1998"&gt;1998&lt;/a&gt; ku sony music distribution, diteruskeu ku album TOXICITY anu dirilis taun &lt;a href="2001"&gt;2001&lt;/a&gt; ku Columbia. STEAL THIS ALBUM dirilis taun &lt;a href="2002"&gt;2002&lt;/a&gt; ku Sony Music Distribution. Dina taun &lt;a href="2005"&gt;2005&lt;/a&gt;, System of a Down ngarilis 2 album, di antarana HYPNOTIZE (dirilis bulan Séptémber) jeung MEZMERIZE (dirilis bulan Méi).
