<h2>Karir</h2>
Karir.
Album pertama Dashboard Confessional, Swiss Army Romance dirilis taun &lt;a href="2000"&gt;2000&lt;/a&gt;, diteruskeun ku album The Places You Have Come To Fear the Most anu dirilis taun &lt;a href="2001"&gt;2001&lt;/a&gt;. Dashboard Confessional boga andil dina album MTV Unplugged 2.0 terus teu lila meunangkeun platinum. Vidéo musik Dashboard pikeun singlena anu dijudulan Screaming Fidelities meunangkeun MTV2 Award dina &lt;a href="MTV%20Video%20Music%20Awards"&gt;MTV Video Music Awards&lt;/a&gt; ngéléhkeun &lt;a href="Norah%20Jones"&gt;Norah Jones&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="The%20Strokes"&gt;The Strokes&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="The%20Hives"&gt;The Hives&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Navy%20Roots"&gt;Navy Roots&lt;/a&gt; jeung &lt;a href="Musiq"&gt;Musiq&lt;/a&gt;. Sanggeus ngaresmikeun personilna di Taun 2003, Dashboard Confessional ngarilis album A Mark, a Mission, a Brand, a Scar anu nempatan peringkat pangluhurna dina Billboard. Dashboard Confessional ogé kungsi ngeusi soundtrack pikeun pilem &lt;a href="Spiderman"&gt;Spiderman&lt;/a&gt; 2, taun &lt;a href="2004"&gt;2004&lt;/a&gt;, judul laguna nyaéta Vindicated.
Carabba ogé kungsi gawé bareng jeung produser &lt;a href="Daniel%20lanois"&gt;Daniel lanois&lt;/a&gt;, anu kungsi jadi produser &lt;a href="U2%20%28grup%20musik%29"&gt;U2&lt;/a&gt; jeung &lt;a href="Don%20Gilmore"&gt;Don Gilmore&lt;/a&gt; nalika ngarilis album Dusk and Summer, taun &lt;a href="2006"&gt;2006&lt;/a&gt;. Sabada dirilis, ieu album nempatan posisi kadua dina tangga lagu Billboard. Diteruskeun ku album The Shade of Poison Trees (&lt;a href="2007"&gt;2007&lt;/a&gt;), jeung The Alter Ending (&lt;a href="2009"&gt;2009&lt;/a&gt;). Dashboard Confessional ogé manggung dina acara bubuka tur &lt;a href="Bon%20Jovi"&gt;Bon Jovi&lt;/a&gt; taun &lt;a href="2010"&gt;2010&lt;/a&gt;.
