Björk

Björk atawa Björk Gudmundsdóttir nyaéta panyanyi katut pencipta lagu anu lahir di &lt;a href="Reykjav%C3%ADk"&gt;Reykjavík&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Islandia"&gt;Islandia&lt;/a&gt; tanggal &lt;a href="22%20Nop%C3%A9mber"&gt;22 Nopémber&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1965"&gt;1965&lt;/a&gt;. Pangaruh musisi &lt;a href="avant-garde"&gt;avant-garde&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="jazz"&gt;jazz&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="electronic"&gt;electronic&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="klasik"&gt;klasik&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="alternatip"&gt;alternatip&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="folk"&gt;folk&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="trip%20hop"&gt;trip hop&lt;/a&gt; jeung &lt;a href="ambient"&gt;ambient&lt;/a&gt; katingali pisan dina musikna. Björk lahir ti kulawarga anu aktip dina kagiatan pulitik sarta sosial anu nyababkeun manéhna peka kana kahirupan nu aya di Sakurilingna.
<h2>Karir</h2>
Karir.
Karirna dimulai ti umur welasan taun, terus ngagabung dina grup musik Spit and Snot (&lt;a href="1979"&gt;1979&lt;/a&gt;). Sanggeus éta, Bjork pundah-pindah grup musik, di antarana: Exodus (&lt;a href="1979"&gt;1979&lt;/a&gt;-&lt;a href="1980"&gt;1980&lt;/a&gt;), Jam-80 (1980), Cactus (périodeuu &lt;a href="1982"&gt;1982&lt;/a&gt;), Stigrim (périodeuu 1982), &lt;a href="Tappi%20T%C3%ADkarrass"&gt;Tappi Tíkarrass&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="1981"&gt;1981&lt;/a&gt;-&lt;a href="1983"&gt;1983&lt;/a&gt;), &lt;a href="Rokka%20Rokka%20Drum"&gt;Rokka Rokka Drum&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="1984"&gt;1984&lt;/a&gt;), &lt;a href="PUKL"&gt;PUKL&lt;/a&gt; (1984), &lt;a href="KUKL"&gt;KUKL&lt;/a&gt; (1983-&lt;a href="1986"&gt;1986&lt;/a&gt;), &lt;a href="The%20Elgar%20Sisters"&gt;The Elgar Sisters&lt;/a&gt; (1983-&lt;a href="1986"&gt;1986&lt;/a&gt;), &lt;a href="The%20Sugarcubes"&gt;The Sugarcubes&lt;/a&gt; (1986-&lt;a href="1992"&gt;1992&lt;/a&gt;), &lt;a href="Hlj%C3%B3msveit%20Konr%C3%A1%C3%B0s%20B"&gt;Hljómsveit Konráðs B&lt;/a&gt; - (périodeuu &lt;a href="1989"&gt;1989&lt;/a&gt;/&lt;a href="1990"&gt;1990&lt;/a&gt;) jeung Björk Guðmundsdóttir &amp; Tríó Guðmundar Ingólfssonar (1990).
Debut solo Björk dimulai taun &lt;a href="1992"&gt;1992&lt;/a&gt;, debut solona dijudulan Debut anu dirilis taun 1993. Di Taun nu sarua, Björk gawé bareng jeung &lt;a href="David%20Arnold"&gt;David Arnold&lt;/a&gt; ngagarap lagu Play Dead pikeun soundtrack pilem The Young Americans (&lt;a href="1993"&gt;1993&lt;/a&gt;). Lian ti éta, Björk ogé jadi béntang pilem dina judul The Juniper Tree (&lt;a href="1990"&gt;1990&lt;/a&gt;), diteruskeun ku pilem Dancer in The Dark (&lt;a href="2000"&gt;2000&lt;/a&gt;) jeung Screaming Masterpiece (&lt;a href="2002"&gt;2002&lt;/a&gt;).
