Dwiki Dharmawan

Dwiki Dharwaman nyaéta salah sahiji musisi Indonésia nu kasohor teu ngan saukur di Indonésia, tapi ogé ka sakuliah dinya. &lt;a href="Sutradara"&gt;Sutradara&lt;/a&gt; pilem, panata tari jeung &lt;a href="ork%C3%A9stra"&gt;orkéstra&lt;/a&gt;, sarta musisi &lt;a href="jazz"&gt;jazz&lt;/a&gt; mancanagara. Lahir di &lt;a href="Bandung"&gt;Bandung&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="19%20Agustus"&gt;19 Agustus&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1966"&gt;1966&lt;/a&gt;. Diajar piano klasik ti umur 7 taun ka &lt;a href="Elfa%20Secioria"&gt;Elfa Secioria&lt;/a&gt;. Tuluy nincak umurna nu ka-13 taun mimiti diajar music jazz. Dina umurna nu ka-17, nyieun &lt;a href="Grup%20Krakatau"&gt;Grup Krakatau&lt;/a&gt; bareng jeung &lt;a href="Pra%20B%20Dharma"&gt;Pra B Dharma&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Budhy%20Haryono"&gt;Budhy Haryono&lt;/a&gt;, jeung &lt;a href="Donny%20Suhendra"&gt;Donny Suhendra&lt;/a&gt;. 
Grup krakatau ieu ngaéksplorasi &lt;a href="gamelan%20sunda"&gt;gamelan sunda&lt;/a&gt; nu dikombinasikeun jeung jazz. Nepi ka kiwari ieu grup geus ngurilingan dunya sarta minton dina sawatara konsér jeung féstival internasional saperti &lt;a href="Montreux%20Jazz"&gt;Montreux Jazz&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="North%20Sea%20Jazz"&gt;North Sea Jazz&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Toronto%20Jazz"&gt;Toronto Jazz&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Vancouver%20Jazz"&gt;Vancouver Jazz&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="GalapaJazz"&gt;GalapaJazz&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Hot%20Summer%20Jazz"&gt;Hot Summer Jazz&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Midem"&gt;Midem&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Festival%20Cervantino"&gt;Festival Cervantino&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Sziget%20Festival"&gt;Sziget Festival&lt;/a&gt; jeung sajabana. Salian ti éta, kungsi minton di sawatara tempat seni pintonan nu kasohor saperti &lt;a href="Lincoln%20Center%20Summer%20Outdoor%20Festival"&gt;Lincoln Center Summer Outdoor Festival&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Chicago%20Cultural%20Center"&gt;Chicago Cultural Center&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Esplanade"&gt;Esplanade&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Beijing%20Concert%20Hall"&gt;Beijing Concert Hall&lt;/a&gt;, sarta &lt;a href="Beijing%20National%20Center%20for%20the%20Performing%20Arts"&gt;Beijing National Center for the Performing Arts&lt;/a&gt; jeung sajabana. 
Taun &lt;a href="1990"&gt;1990&lt;/a&gt; Dwiki mimiti neuleuman rupa-rupa wangun musik tradisional tuluy nyieun album &lt;a href="Mystical%20Mist"&gt;Mystical Mist&lt;/a&gt; jeung &lt;a href="Magical%20Match"&gt;Magical Match&lt;/a&gt;. Taun &lt;a href="2005"&gt;2005&lt;/a&gt; jadi co-music director pikeun pagelaran musik spéktakulér &lt;a href="Megalithicum%20Quantum"&gt;Megalithicum Quantum&lt;/a&gt; di &lt;a href="Jakarta"&gt;Jakarta&lt;/a&gt; jeung &lt;a href="Bali"&gt;Bali&lt;/a&gt; bareng jeung Krakatau. Salian ti éta musik Krakatau ogé geus diaku sacara internasional. Hal ieu dibuktikeun ku ayana Jurnal Worlds of Music nu medal di &lt;a href="Amerika%20Serikat"&gt;Amerika Serikat&lt;/a&gt; nu nyebutkeun yén Krakatau téh bagian penting dina khazanah World Music alatan Krakatau geus bisa ngadumaniskeun &lt;a href="gamelan"&gt;gamelan&lt;/a&gt; sarta musik-musik tradisional lianna jeung musik jazz. 
Tepi ka taun &lt;a href="2006"&gt;2006&lt;/a&gt; Dwiki geus nyieun album bareng jeung Krakatau nyaéta &lt;a href="First%20Album"&gt;First Album&lt;/a&gt;(&lt;a href="1987"&gt;1987&lt;/a&gt;), &lt;a href="Second%20Album"&gt;Second Album&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="1988"&gt;1988&lt;/a&gt;), &lt;a href="Kembali%20Satu"&gt;Kembali Satu&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="1989"&gt;1989&lt;/a&gt;), &lt;a href="Let%20There%20Be%20Life"&gt;Let There Be Life&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="1992"&gt;1992&lt;/a&gt;),Mystical Mist (&lt;a href="1994"&gt;1994&lt;/a&gt;), &lt;a href="Magical%20Match"&gt;Magical Match&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="2000"&gt;2000&lt;/a&gt;), &lt;a href="2%20Worlds"&gt;2 Worlds&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="2006"&gt;2006&lt;/a&gt;) jeung &lt;a href="Rhytym%20Of%20Reformation"&gt;Rhytym Of Reformation&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="2006"&gt;2006&lt;/a&gt;). Ari Dwiki sorangan geus nyieun album solona kalawan judul &lt;a href="Nuansa"&gt;Nuansa&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="2002"&gt;2002&lt;/a&gt;) bareng jeung musisi dunya saperti &lt;a href="Mike%20Stern"&gt;Mike Stern&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Lincoln%20Goiness"&gt;Lincoln Goiness&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Richie%20Morales"&gt;Richie Morales&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Neil%20Stubenhaus"&gt;Neil Stubenhaus&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Ricky%20Lawson"&gt;Ricky Lawson&lt;/a&gt; jeung &lt;a href="Mike%20Thompson"&gt;Mike Thompson&lt;/a&gt; ti &lt;a href="Amerika"&gt;Amerika&lt;/a&gt; sarta sababaraha musisi &lt;a href="Australia"&gt;Australia&lt;/a&gt; saperti &lt;a href="Steve%20Hunter"&gt;Steve Hunter&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="David%20Jones"&gt;David Jones&lt;/a&gt; jeung &lt;a href="Guy%20Strazullo"&gt;Guy Strazullo&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Prestasi</h2>
Prestasi.
Préstasi Darmawan di antarana waé kungsi meunang panglélér Penata Musik Terbaik &lt;a href="Festival%20Film%20Indonesia"&gt;Festival Film Indonesia&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1991"&gt;1991&lt;/a&gt; dina pilemna &lt;a href="Cinta%20Dalam%20Sepotong%20Roti"&gt;Cinta Dalam Sepotong Roti&lt;/a&gt; karya &lt;a href="Garin%20Nugroho"&gt;Garin Nugroho&lt;/a&gt;. Taun &lt;a href="1985"&gt;1985&lt;/a&gt; meunang panglélér The Best Keyboard Player dina &lt;a href="Yamaha%20Light%20Music%20Contest"&gt;Yamaha Light Music Contest&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1985"&gt;1985&lt;/a&gt; di &lt;a href="Tokyo"&gt;Tokyo&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Jepang"&gt;Jepang&lt;/a&gt;.
Salian seniman, Dwiki ogé jadi Direktur &lt;a href="Lembaga%20Atikan%20Musik%20Farabi"&gt;Lembaga Atikan Musik Farabi&lt;/a&gt; jeung anggota komite musik &lt;a href="Dewan%20Kesenian%20Jakarta"&gt;Dewan Kesenian Jakarta&lt;/a&gt;.
